app.reclaim.intro = Nothing is selected. Tick what you want to move to the Trash: every path, what it is and what deleting it costs are listed below, and you confirm once more before anything moves.
app.reclaim.kind_merged = Merged worktrees
app.reclaim.how_merged = Their branch is on the default branch with nothing uncommitted or unpushed. The whole folder goes to the Trash, including files git ignores, and git forgets the worktree.
app.reclaim.kind_incremental = Incremental build caches
app.reclaim.how_trash = Moved to the Trash, never deleted outright. The space comes back when you empty the Trash.
app.reclaim.kind_stale_target.one = Build folders of worktrees untouched for {n} day
app.reclaim.kind_stale_target.other = Build folders of worktrees untouched for {n} days
